{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rotten\u202fSails \u2014 Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Helm a cursed cutter with up to\u202f3 friends. Plunder forbidden treasure for the Black\u202fArmada and get out alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What you\u2019ll try</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 Region, 3 Islands</strong> \u2013 each with its own secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Loop</strong> \u2013 light the lantern, dive, haul loot, escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co\u2011op Horror</strong> \u2013 voices fade with distance; lose a mate, lose hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ship Upkeep</strong> \u2013 patch, bail, steer; one leak too many and you\u2019re done.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Carry\u2011Over Progress</strong> \u2013 survive to unlock a tougher night cycle in the full game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dare to descend.</strong> Every coin draws darker things to the hull. How deep will you go before the sea claims all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741490/extras/shipsinkinggif.gif?t=1747261352\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741490?t=1747261352","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741490?t=1747261352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741490/a80a2af6f1813387d3b9ce363265d3d7a861a083/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747261352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741490/a80a2af6f1813387d3b9ce363265d3d7a861a083/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747261352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"descripti